{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412120","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1041212001:1":{"text":"Kafra, you're a marvelous swordsman!","source_cn":"卡夫拉，你的剑术十分了得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32D206EDDD68FEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041212002:1":{"text":"If you have some time, would you give me some tips?","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，不知你能否为我指点一二？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x708B339E870163A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041212003:1":{"text":"You're too kind. This sword technique slices through the wind. Ramp up the speed like this, and the strikes will flow!","source_cn":"咕唔，无需客气，埃隆大人！此剑法破风而行，只需如吾这般...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE45BC4F12B5444C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041212004:1":{"text":"I understand. It's tough to be as swift as you, though. I suppose I need to train much harder...","source_cn":"原来如此。只是想像你这般敏捷并不容易，看来我仍旧需要多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B280A7C35286B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041212005:1":{"text":"But... he's got four legs! Eironn, I doubt you can ever match that speed!","source_cn":"可是……他有四条腿呀！埃隆你怎么也跑不到那个速度吧！！"